:: Asylum Depths Intro
<<effects>>

A decrepit corridor runs between the cells, living areas, and treatment centre. A chain blocks the entrance beneath a "NO ENTRY" sign. Wallpaper peels from the walls, and the corridor grows darker towards the far end. Several rooms open from it, with a staircase beyond them.
<br><br>

<<npc Harper>><<person1>>
"시설의 그 구역은 사용하지 않습니다." 누군가 말한다. 하퍼다. "예전에는 이곳에 환자가 더 많았습니다. 가까이 가지 마십시오. 관리가 되지 않아 위험합니다."
<br><br>

An orderly arrives and catches Harper's eye. Harper gives <<him>> a nod, smiles at you, then leaves with <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[다음|Asylum]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths
<<asylumeffects>><<effects>>

You stand in the disused corridor. Open doors reveal rooms coated with dust and grime, while other doorways lead into branching hallways. You keep track of the way back as you look around.
<br><br>

<<if $asylumstate is "sleep">>
	정신병원의 거주 구역은 취침 시간이다. 돌아가지 않으면 자리를 비운 것을 들킬 수도 있다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Asylum]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $asylumstate is "exercise" and $daily.asylumExercise isnot 1>>
