:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4
<<effects>>

조명이 깜빡이다 꺼지고, 당신은 어둠 속에 갇힌다.
<br><br>

"Sorry for the interruption, folks," says a voice. "We'll have the lights on in a jiffy." A few seconds later, the lights return. You're standing behind the stage, peeking out from behind the curtain.
<br><br>

"준비되셨죠." <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 당신의 어깨에 손을 얹으며 말한다. "실망시키지 않을 거라 믿습니다."
<br><br>


<<link [[다음|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 2
<<effects>>

The <<person>> steps by you, out onto the stage. "Ladies and gentlemen," <<he>> says. "It's time for the main event. You probably know <<phim stranger>> as <<overworld_nickname>>. The more daring of you might know <<phim stranger>> as <<underworld_nickname>>. Regardless, please join me in a round of applause for the greatest sensation this town has ever produced."
<br><br>

The <<person>> bows and steps aside as you walk onto the stage. The applause is deafening.
<br><br>

<<link [[농담을 한다|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Joke]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[춤춘다|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[이건 진짜가 아니다|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Willpower]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Joke
<<effects>>

You wait for a gap in the applause, then tell a joke. A few people laugh first, followed by the rest of the audience until the room fills with it.
<br><br>

<<link [[춤춘다|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[이건 진짜가 아니다|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Willpower]]>><</link>><<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000>>
<br>


:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Willpower
<<effects>>

You look past the stage lights and remember the dusty room around you. You're standing in front of an array of mirrors.
<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	기이하긴 해도, 당신은 정신병원에 있으며 그 사실을 잊는 것은 위험할 수 있다. 그 생각과 함께, <span class="green">당신은 거울 방으로 돌아오지만,</span> 여전히 관객들이 기다리고 있는 장면이 눈앞에 펼쳐진다.
	<br><br>

	Then you notice dark gaps between members of the audience. Something seems to be watching through them. You focus on the gaps, trying to make out a shape. A rush of unfamiliar emotion hits you, first curiosity, then panic.
	<br><br>

	당신은 정신을 잃는다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	The stage takes over your attention again. <span class="red">Your feet begin tapping to the music</span> before you can stop them.<<gwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance
<<effects>>

Music starts as the lights shift, leaving the audience in darkness while the stage stays bright. A dim orchestra is visible to one side. You keep dancing under the audience's attention, picking up speed as the music pushes you on despite your growing fatigue.<<lllawareness>><<llltrauma>><<awareness -18>><<trauma -18>>
<br><br>

You push yourself faster until your legs give way, sending you down onto the stage.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3
<<effects>>


<<npc Harper>><<person1>>
당신은 병실 침대에서 깨어난다. 하퍼 의사가 근심스러운 표정으로 당신을 내려다보고 있다.
<br><br>

"무사해서 다행입니다." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "거울로 둘러싸인 금지 구역에서 당신을 발견했습니다. 기분은 어떻습니까?"
<br><br>

<<link [[괜찮다고 말한다|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Fine]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[<<him>>에게 당장 내 관객들에게 데려가 달라고 말한다|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Audience]]>><<awareness -6>><<trauma -6>><</link>><<lawareness>><<ltrauma>>
<br>
<<link [[침묵한다|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Silent]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Fine
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"저 괜찮아요." 당신이 말한다. "걱정 끼쳐드려서 죄송해요."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You look down at the blanket. "I'm okay," you say. "Sorry if I worried you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'm fine," you say, settling back against the bed. "You don't need to stay."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"I'm all right, thank you," you say. "Sorry for the trouble."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You raise a hand from the bed. "Still alive," you say. "No need to fuss."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"나 괜찮아." 당신이 말한다. "신경 꺼."
<<else>>
	"괜찮아요." 당신이 말한다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Harper gives you a small smile, though <<his>> brow stays furrowed. "As you say. I'll leave you to your peace. Be well." <<He>> leaves your cell and closes the door behind <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<earnFeat "Mirror Madness">>
<span class="gold">거울의 광기 특성을 얻었습니다.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Asylum Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Audience
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	당신은 벌떡 일어난다. "제 관객들이요!" 당신이 말한다. "절 기다리고 있을 거예요."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You sit straighter. "My audience is waiting," you say. "Could you take me to them, please?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You fold your hands in your lap. "I need to see my audience," you say. "Please take me to them."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"My audience is waiting for me," you say. "Would you take me to them, please?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You sit up and spread your arms. "At last. Take me to my audience. I can't keep them waiting."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"관객들한테 데려다 줘." 당신이 말한다. "그리고 물 한 잔도. 똑바로 서 있으려면 필요하거든."
<<else>>
	"관객들이 날 기다리고 있어요." 당신이 말한다. "그거 말곤 괜찮아요."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Harper's brow furrows. <<He>> gives you a careful smile. "We'll talk about that later," <<he>> says. "If you like. For now I'll leave you to your peace. Be well." <<He>> leaves your cell and closes the door behind <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<earnFeat "Mirror Madness">>
<span class="gold">거울의 광기 특성을 얻었습니다.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Asylum Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Silent
<<effects>>

당신은 침묵을 지킨다. 하퍼가 미소를 짓는데, 눈살을 찌푸릴 때보다 더 근심스러워 보인다. "무슨 일이 있었든 간에." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "원하신다면 나중에 이야기할 수 있습니다. 일단은 편히 쉬도록 혼자 두겠습니다. 안정하십시오." <<He>>【은는】 병실을 떠나며 뒤로 문을 닫는다.
