:: Asylum Depths Tunnels 4 Pull
<<effects>>

You pull the lever. The cage door scrapes upwards with a loud metallic screech. The creature stays still until the door clears the floor, then steps into the weak light and straightens to its full height. It looks down at you before leaping into the water. No splash follows. You shiver.
<br><br>

방 안을 둘러보지만 다른 것은 거의 없다. 당신은 정원으로 헤엄쳐 돌아와 몸을 닦고 옷을 입은 뒤, 정신병원으로 들어간다.
<br><br>

<<earnFeat "Eyes in the Night">>
<span class="gold">야행성 눈 특성을 얻었습니다.</span>
<br><br>

